# TWO-LABEL: name:            two_term
# TWO: LUI
# TWO: ADDI32
# Near-cond branch keeps the ORIGINAL polarity family (BEQZ_W's inverse
# is BNEZ_W): the promotion inverts the condition so JALR takes the far
# edge and the near branch guards the fallthrough-to-near edge.
# TWO: BNEZ{{.*}} $r2, {{.*}}bb.1
# TWO: JALR
# TWO-NOT: B %bb.2
#
# ONE-LABEL: name:            one_term
# ONE-NOT: LUI
# ONE: B %bb.1
